\newlabel{fig:sigma}{{5}{7}{\textbf {Reproduction gap and operating-point sensitivity.} \emph {Left:} baseline AUROC vs smoothing $\sigma $; smoothing accounts for $\sim $1.6 pp, leaving a residual gap to the published $0.855$ (see text). \emph {Right:} at $\sigma {=}20$ the overall-AUROC advantage of the context model nearly vanishes}{figure.5}{}}
